[0020] The at least one data packet may further include sensor data, and the processor of the device may be further configured storing the sensor data and the unique tag ID on the memory, and transmitting the sensor data and the unique tag ID to an external server.
[0021] The at least one data packet may further include a plurality of data packets, where each one of the data packets includes a respective data packet ID.",
  "brief_description_of_drawing": "[0058] FIG. 1 depicts an example system for the tracking and gathering of sensor data from tags attachable to assets in a supply chain;
