the one or more cabling is a USB (universal serial bus) cable;
a plurality of USB chips disposed on the primary and secondary device, respectively, wherein the plurality of USB chips comprises of circuitry that manages power and data communication of the USB cable;
a switching circuit disposed between the one or more cabling and the connection end; and
