(c4) marking the selected unprocessed version as pro- cessed; and
(c5) repeating (c1) through (c4) until there are no more unprocessed versions in the respective scenario's SVL;
(c6) marking the selected scenario as processed; and
repeating (c5) and (c6) until there are no more unpro- cessed scenarios.
