responsive to the message, identifying a list of substitute items that can be obtained in lieu of the next item that is unavailable;
retrieving a position in the retailer location for each substitute item;
applying the fulfillment optimization model to the current position of the smart shopping cart and the positions of the substitute items to identify one of the substitute items to obtain in lieu of the next item that is unavailable; and
displaying, via the electronic display, the substitute item.
