Abstract: The present invention relates generally to the technological field of payment systems. More specifically, the present invention relates to technical solutions for performing payment transactions from inside a vehicle, also known as in-vehicle payment systems (ICPS). The claimed invention represents the system and method of authorizing and performing payment transactions, which provide an improvement of the technological field of payment systems by increasing security of in-vehicle payments, while maintaining the procedure easy and convenient to the consumer, in particular, by requiring consumer interaction with in-vehicle computer only.

